        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "weak",
        "rationale": "Although turnover is expected, ambiguity about interim governance can alter precise timing but not the overall outcome."
      },
      {
        "factor": "Prediction-market re-pricing after event",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "strong",
        "rationale": "Markets quickly shifted toward near-certain turnover after death announcement, validating the posterior adjustment."
      },
      {
        "factor": "Short time horizon to April 1, 2026",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "A narrow window constrains the transition, making delay unlikely."
      }
    ],
    "synthesis_rationale": "Starting from a low baseline anchor, the death event provides a strong positive update; the constitutional mechanism and rapid market re-pricing further lift the probability. The posterior 0.66 reflects correlation among updates and acknowledges residual uncertainty about exact timing; there is also potential for delays or contested announcements that could temper the final outcome."
  }
}

